    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">Given an integer <var>index</var> and a binary string <var>binaryString</var>, apply an inversion wave centered at <var>index</var>.<br><br>Flip the bit at <var>index</var> and any existing adjacent neighbors (<pre style=\"font-family: monospace\">index - 1</pre> and <pre style=\"font-family: monospace\">index + 1</pre>).<br>- A <pre style=\"font-family: monospace\">'0'</pre> flips to <pre style=\"font-family: monospace\">'1'</pre><br>- A <pre style=\"font-family: monospace\">'1'</pre> flips to <pre style=\"font-family: monospace\">'0'</pre><br><br>All other bits remain untouched. If a neighbor index falls outside the string bounds, ignore it.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\">Line 1: An integer <var>index</var> representing the pulse center.<br>Line 2: A string <var>binaryString</var> containing only characters <pre style=\"font-family: monospace\">0</pre> and <pre style=\"font-family: monospace\">1</pre>.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\">A single line containing the resulting binary string.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\">0 &le; <var>index</var> &lt; length of <var>binaryString</var> &le; 100</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">2\n00000</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">01110</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
